# Crash reports written by the program when something goes unhandled (the CRASH
# REPORTING section of the .pyw). The log is written beside the program, so running
# the .pyw from source leaves one in "GUI Source Code"; the installed program leaves
# its own beside the exe under %LOCALAPPDATA%\Programs\yt-msd.
yt-msd-crash.log

